<title>FRANCE: IMS buys British stainless steel distributor.</title>
<headline>IMS buys British stainless steel distributor.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>IMS, a unit of Usinor-Sacilor, said it had bought 100 percent of Athena Stainless Steels of Britain for an unspecified amount.</p>
<p>Athena had 1995 sales of 70 million francs.</p>
</text>
